Hi Nick,

Odd indeed. I have found the same thing on two different dataset one with 55 taxa and another with 287. I think I have been looking at complete tables. I have used the command ana_events_table = ana_events_tables[[x]] and appending all 50 simulations to a csv file. I have attached one of the map files in csv format below in case you have the time to see if I’m just misinterpreting things.

Even though some event times precede my first stratum there are very few of these events across all simulations, which raises red (I’ve-messed-something-up) flags in my mind.

As always, thanks for your help!

Best,
