[1] "Error in ranges_list[[new_rangenum_1based]] : \n  attempt to select less than one element in get1index\n"
attr(,"class")
[1] "try-error"
attr(,"condition")
<simpleError in ranges_list[[new_rangenum_1based]]: attempt to select less than one element in get1index>

ranges_list is populated with my manually adjusted ranges, but ranges_list[[new_rangenum_1based]] is not found. Any thoughts?

Thanks!
Chauncey

